\caption{Null-control FPR by method ($\alpha{=}0.0$, 6~seeds 45--50, 6-pair basis). Bars: pooled FPR; dots: per-seed FPR. Updated 9-seed pooled rates in Table~\ref{tab:null_fpr_methods}.}
\label{fig:null_fpr_diagnostic}
